CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/i/a com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/mod/ModManager
	COMMENT Mod manager (UNRESOLVED NAME - left obfuscated): loads/refreshes all installed mods from CustomUnitMetadataLoader dirs, holds the mod list (e), mod->extra-map links (f), disable/enable selection (d/f/g), modSettings (de)serialization, version comparison ("Requires version: %s or higher. (You have: %s)", build suffix "p<build>"), and modSettings/modSettingsVersion write-back to SettingsEngine. Called from librocket/scripts/Mods. Likely original name ModManager, but the iOS symbols list contains no mod package, so per rule the class is intentionally not renamed.
